{"created": "2023-07-09T19:25:47.812156+00:00", "modified": "2023-07-10T02:26:52.106676+00:00", "id": 8127870, "conceptrecid": "8127869", "doi": "10.1145/3522618", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.1145/3522618", "metadata": {"title": "100STYLE Dataset", "doi": "10.1145/3522618", "publication_date": "2022-05-04", "description": "<p>This is the 100STYLE dataset originally presented in the work&nbsp;<em>Real-Time Style Modelling of Human Locomotion via Feature-Wise Transformations and Local Motion Phases</em>.</p>\n\n<p>This dataset contains over four million frames of stylized motion capture data. Both original bvh motion capture files (100STYLE.zip) and processed data (100Style-Labelled-Data.zip) are provided. The data is labelled using the hybrid approach to local phases described in the paper alongside the extraction of motion features such as joint positions, rotations and velocities. InputLabels.txt and OutputLabels.txt describe each of the feature dimensions extracted.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Mason, Ian", "affiliation": "MIT", "orcid": "0000-0003-3091-9045"}, {"name": "Starke, Sebastian", "affiliation": "Meta"}, {"name": "Komura, Taku", "affiliation": "HKU"}], "keywords": ["motion capture", "mocap", "machine learning", "deep learning", "animation"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "8127869"}}]}}, "title": "100STYLE Dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8127870", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8127870", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8127870?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.1145/3522618", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.1145/3522618", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.1145/3522618", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8127870/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8127869", "parent_html": "